  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "So to speak, you should take on time for this ",
      "test. You'd better find good weapon for the ",
      "test.",
      "",
      "If you hunt the monsters on time, come back ",
      "to me. If you don't come to me even you ",
      "finished all quests, you must come to see me ",
      "again. If you miss the time, you will fail the",
      "test. Be careful!. If you miss the time, come ",
      "back to me again and then get the quest again.",
      "",
      "If you click ok, the time will be counted.",
      "So, you do better to buy Potions before you ",
      "click ok."
    ]
